stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Issued
    Issued --> Valid: Signature and expiry valid
    Valid --> Completed: Booking completed
    Valid --> Expired: Expiry timestamp reached
    Issued --> Invalid: Signature mismatch or malformed
    Expired --> Released: Worker/database sweep
    Invalid --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
